### 1. Connection Establishment Now Dominates

```
Container spawn: 100ms (your goal)
TCP handshake:   50-150ms (depending on distance)
TLS handshake:   50-100ms
DNS resolution:  1-50ms
Total cold path: 200-400ms
```

**Solution**: Connection pooling, pre-established connections, 0-RTT TLS

